    "raw": "Homepage feature \u2014 Company Brain"
  },
  "content": {
    "raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n    <!-- COMPANY BRAIN -->\n    <div class=\"plw-layer\" id=\"company-brain\">\n      <div class=\"plw-cols\">\n        <div class=\"is-media plw-reveal\">\n          <div class=\"plw-device\">\n            <div class=\"plw-device-bar\"><span class=\"plw-dot\"></span><span class=\"plw-dot\"></span><span class=\"plw-dot\"></span><span class=\"plw-device-url\">Company Brain</span><span class=\"plw-live\">Beta</span></div>\n            <a href=\"https://parallellabs.app/company-brain/\" aria-label=\"Explore Company Brain and its setup guide\" style=\"display:block\">\n              <img src=\"https://parallellabs.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01-directory.jpg\" alt=\"Company Brain directory showing people, companies, recent engagement, and a connected relationship brief with fictional demo data\" width=\"2051\" height=\"1004\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" />\n            </a>\n          </div>\n          <p style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--plw-fg3);text-align:center\">Real product interface &middot; Fictional demo data</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plw-reveal\">\n          <p class=\"plw-eyebrow\">06 &middot; Company Brain</p>\n          <h3 class=\"plw-h3\">Every relationship. <span class=\"plw-serif\">One connected story.</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"plw-lede\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Bring people, companies, conversations, and activity together &mdash; so your next conversation starts with context.</p>\n          <table class=\"plw-spec\">\n            <tr><th>Connected profiles</th><td>See contact details, linked records, and source evidence in one place. Review uncertain identity matches.</td></tr>\n            <tr><th>Meaningful engagement</th><td>Find the people replying, messaging your agents, clicking, and booking &mdash; with a timeline of the activity behind each relationship.</td></tr>\n            <tr><th>Company networks</th><td>Explore the connections between people, their companies, and the sources that brought them together.</td></tr>\n            <tr><th>CRM + meetings</th><td>Connect HubSpot, Salesforce, or GoHighLevel, then enable Google Calendar or Zoom activity sync.</td></tr>\n          </table>\n          <p style=\"margin-top:22px\"><a href=\"https://parallellabs.app/company-brain/\" style=\"color:var(--plw-fg);font-weight:500;border-bottom:1px solid var(--plw-line)\">Explore Company Brain <span class=\"plw-arr\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->",
    "protected": false,
    "block_version": 1
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "raw": "",
    "rendered": "<p>Company BrainBeta Real product interface &middot; Fictional demo data 06 &middot; Company Brain Every relationship. One connected story. Bring people, companies, conversations, and activity together &mdash; so your next conversation starts with context. Connected profiles See contact details, linked records, and source evidence in one place. Review uncertain identity matches. Meaningful engagement Find the people [&hellip;]</p>\n",
